		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Indigo-scaled Abyssal dragon that loves being worshipped by mortals.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 67, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 corroding breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (burrow, fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 14</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acidblood</strong>. Acid immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Corroding Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending double near from dragon. DEX 15+ or 4d8 damage. Organic material or metal hit dissolves on a d6 roll of 1-3.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
